        ink('33:1-29', 'the receipt seats by the finder %s — NONE in the chapter; the register file untouched; the pointers ahead 34:6 (FORWARD at 33:21), 34:1-4, 34:4; Joshua 10:24 and 14:6, Habakkuk 3:3 and 3:6, Psalm 90:1, 4:6, 51:21, 2 Kings 18:32, Isaiah 36:17, Ezra 4:3, 1 Chronicles 11:10' % (rc,))
        dat("no receipt, header or footer in the chapter (good_land.receipt_seats(33) -> []); THE POINTERS AHEAD OWED under the lean pass's debt line — no pointer row for them; THE TWO POINTER ROWS 33:5 and 33:28 20b's owed rows PAID (grade R); the run citations filed from the gate's print")
